EqnTide (including the native desktop editor, equation image/preview rendering
engine, DOCX package editing/upgrade pipeline, local bridge, and Office add-ins)
was written by Anh <vananh2801> and contributors, and incorporates or references
code, binary format mappings, fonts, icons, and specifications from multiple
third-party open-source projects and standards:

