   Author: Bohdan Bodnarenko
   License: MIT License
   Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Bohdan Bodnarenko
   Description:
     Referenced and adapted for initial OMML-to-MTEF 5.0 binary encoding concepts
     and OLE compound file container layout.

